              "t": "text",
              "v": "Two terms of the conjecture are contested. Whether Even(v) counts v itself, and whether the range of the distance spectrum is the number of distinct distance eigenvalues or the extent of the spectrum, are enumerated as a convention record with one verdict per reading rather than settled in this prose. The verdict for each reading is an exact evaluation, not a judgement about what the source meant."
            }
          ],
