              "v": "A previously published candidate for the same conjecture is C4. Its witness was replayed by this repository's own exact engine under all four enumerated readings rather than read off the prior paper's reported numbers: it refutes under one reading and not under the other three. The prior-art classification that records this comparison is bound to the same reading set."
            }
